php bin/console make:user</code></pre><p>This command will create a new UserFixture in the src/DataFixtures directory.</p><p><strong>Create a UserController:</strong><br>To create a UserController, run the following command:</p><pre><code class="language-php">php bin/console make:controller</code></pre><p>This command will create a new UserController in the src/Controller directory.</p><p><strong>Update the UserController:</strong><br>Update the UserController to require authentication for all actions, except the login and registration actions. Here is an example:</p><pre><code class="language-php">
