}</code></pre><p>In this example, we are using the @IsGranted annotation to require the ROLE_USER and ROLE_ADMIN roles for the index and admin actions, respectively.</p><p><strong>Create a login form:</strong><br>To create a login form, update the login action in the UserController. Here is an example:</p><pre><code class="language-php">
